    "The SMILES for C10 does not match the lamotrigine structure, but the record text identifies lamotrigine, which is the query; if the SMILES is taken literally, the direct evidence would be lost.",
    "No direct experimental data for the exact query beyond lamotrigine records; however, the query is lamotrigine.",
    "No data on solubility, permeability, or first-pass metabolism for the query beyond the bioavailability records."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [],
  "revision_action": "initial"
}

